IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-KV-SPARSIFY.

DATA DIVISION.
01 DIMENSION           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 THRESHOLD-INT       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PRUNED-COUNT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPARSITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPARSIFY.
    IF DIMENSION == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE PRUNED-COUNT TO SPARSITY-PCT.
    MULTIPLY 100 BY SPARSITY-PCT.
    DIVIDE DIMENSION INTO SPARSITY-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SPARSITY-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 PRUNED-COUNT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
